  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/818/259/capa-3.png\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>⚠注意</strong>：自2026年1月8日起，Heycronus團隊的所有專案將正式透過CurseForge、Modrinth和Planet Minecraft上的devHeycronus帳號獨家發布與維護。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">「<strong><span style=\"color:#f90\">Better Woods</span></strong>」材質包全面視覺升級Minecraft中的所有木材，提供更美觀且現代的外觀。每種木質方塊均經過精心重製，讓您在遊戲中建造時享受更愉悅且風格化的體驗。無論是鄉村小屋還是現代建築，「Better Woods」都能將作品的視覺層次提升至全新境界。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fdonate%252f%253fbusiness%253dLAEZJ6TS7CYP6%2526no_recurring%253d0%2526item_name%253dHelp%2bme%2bcontinue%2bwith%2bthe%2bprojects%2bwith%2ba%2bsimple%2bdonation%2b-%2bHeycronus%2526currency_code%253dUSD\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"font-weight:400;display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1013293/description_41c410a1-3705-48e1-9d6d-faca354f3234.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"248\" height=\"93\"></a><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">「<strong><span style=\"color:#f90\">Better Woods</span></strong>」是一款重新定義Minecraft木材外觀的材質包，使其更顯美觀與現代化。從橡木到相思木，每種木材類型皆經過重新設計，在遊戲建造過程中提供令人驚豔的視覺體驗。若您想為建築增添優雅氣息，「Better Woods」將是完美選擇。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1291/574/sem-tatulo-2-png.png\"></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/818/260/capa-1.png\"></span></p>",
